      "message": "Why don\u0027t we do high-to-low instead? Is there a difference?\n\nI\u0027m nervous that instead of resetting we\u0027ll just be waking up from hibernate if we do the rising edge. Isn\u0027t there a slight difference between the wake-from-hibernate boot and reset?",
